---
import SectionHeading from './SectionHeading.astro';
---

<section id="about" class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 py-24">
  <SectionHeading title="About Me" />
  <div class="grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-5">
    <div class="space-y-4 text-slate-400 leading-relaxed md:col-span-3">
      <p>
        Hello! I'm a Computer Science undergraduate student with work experience at a variety of well-established companies such as ARM.
      </p>
      <p>
        I'm passionate about creating modern software solutions that prioritise the user-experience, rather than the financial gain.
        The landscape of the modern internet is rapidly evolving, with innovations in technology being made at breakneck speeds. And with that, comes corporate greed. 
      </p>
      <p>
        My goal is to give control and privacy back to the everyday person, creating a safe, efficient, and welcoming landscape, where the needs of the many are put over the needs of the 1%.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="md:col-span-2">
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/5 p-6 font-mono text-sm text-emerald-300">
        <p class="mb-2 text-slate-400">// quick facts</p>
        <ul class="space-y-1">
          <li>📍 Location: Earth</li>
          <li>💼 Role: Full-stack dev</li>
          <li>🎓 Lifelong learner</li>
          <li>☕ Fueled by coffee</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>